tickets.body:
Adjust the epic workspace stylesheets for the new tokens: `epic/epic.css`, `epic/tones.css`, `graph/graph.css`, `ticket/ticket.css`, `checkpoint/checkpoint.css` and `markdown/markdown.css` under `src/renderer/src/`.

**Focus areas:**
- the dotted graph canvas and node cards on the new surfaces;
- edge strokes, where accepted (solid) and waiting (dashed) must stay easy to tell apart;
- the selected-node ring and the running glow;
- sprint checkpoint dividers;
- state pills and dots, where every state must stay distinct and keep its text label;
- the ticket side panel and its tabs;
- checkpoint gate rows;
- Markdown code blocks and links.

Follow the roles and collision rules in `docs/design/palette.md`.

**Out of scope:** `styles.css` shell rules (they have their own ticket), graph layout, React Flow behavior.

**Verify:** before and after screenshots of a plan graph mid-run with several ticket states visible, a draft with a validation error, the ticket panel, and a sprint checkpoint with a failed gate.
